(4248349, 610624, 72094, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, it makes me feel like the dart has just landed and is still vibrating.  I am a strong believer in balance as you have with the red in the bull(your subject) and the flag of your dart.  The overall image is very sharp, like the point of the dart. GREAT WORK. Very good graphical shot.</td>', 'This is a great photo, it makes me feel like the dart has just landed and is still vibrating.  I am a strong believer in balance as you have with the red in the bull(your subject) and the flag of your dart.  The overall image is very sharp, like the point of the dart. GREAT WORK. Very good graphical shot.', '2007-11-14 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248360, 611013, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Like how you left the brown in the corner for added context.  Bigger (640) would have been better.  Difficult, but perhaps a little more sunflowers in ''the rear''.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Like how you left the brown in the corner for added context.  Bigger (640) would have been better.  Difficult, but perhaps a little more sunflowers in ''the rear''.', '2007-11-15 00:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248362, 612620, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Ah, yes.  You managed to get ''both'' bokeh.  Well done.  Colors are nice, although look slightly unnatural, but I think this is because of the blue reflected in the drops.  Nice image.<i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-30 00:39:14.</i></td>', '7 - Ah, yes.  You managed to get ''both'' bokeh.  Well done.  Colors are nice, although look slightly unnatural, but I think this is because of the blue reflected in the drops.  Nice image.edit:typo', '2007-11-15 00:03:26.000000', '2007-11-30 00:39:14.000000', 1),
(4248363, 611210, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.  Nice isolation.  Toning works well.</td>', '7 - Nice image.  Nice isolation.  Toning works well.', '2007-11-15 00:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248365, 611027, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful image.  Good use of the technique.</td>', '8 - Beautiful image.  Good use of the technique.', '2007-11-15 00:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248367, 613060, 39850, '<td valign="top">Like to have seen the fore bokeh stronger.  Seems to be some issues in the color of the neck of the flamingo at the fore - could be my monitor though.</td>', 'Like to have seen the fore bokeh stronger.  Seems to be some issues in the color of the neck of the flamingo at the fore - could be my monitor though.', '2007-11-15 00:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
