(4248990, 611532, 66414, '<td valign="top">I like the red/orange tones of whatever is in the foreground of the picture.  I''m not such a fan of the green out of focus part in the middle it distracts from an otherwise good photo.</td>', 'I like the red/orange tones of whatever is in the foreground of the picture.  I''m not such a fan of the green out of focus part in the middle it distracts from an otherwise good photo.', '2007-11-15 09:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
