(4249071, 612790, 63398, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this qualifies in my mind or not. It seems to me that the Bokeh is both in the foreground and is the subject. I can''t really fault it, but it''s a new concept and I like to think I''m open to new things. 7</td>', 'I don''t know if this qualifies in my mind or not. It seems to me that the Bokeh is both in the foreground and is the subject. I can''t really fault it, but it''s a new concept and I like to think I''m open to new things. 7', '2007-11-15 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249181, 613064, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a terrific job and a lovely image!!!! 7</td>', 'What a terrific job and a lovely image!!!! 7', '2007-11-15 11:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249191, 612371, 21915, '<td valign="top">Watch out for that direct sunlight as it''s overexposed</td>', 'Watch out for that direct sunlight as it''s overexposed', '2007-11-15 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249232, 612423, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is just not a very good picture.  If you''re going to make a nude, at least it should be interesting or artistic, but this is just there, and grainy.  (3)</td>', 'This is just not a very good picture.  If you''re going to make a nude, at least it should be interesting or artistic, but this is just there, and grainy.  (3)', '2007-11-15 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249237, 612371, 5112, '<td valign="top">Backlit images are tricky.  Cameras have a difficult time metering in these situations.  Sometimes it helps to use manual and underexpose by a fair bit.  There is a bit of foreground bokeh here, but it''s minimal, and it doesn''t really "enhance" the image.  (5)</td>', 'Backlit images are tricky.  Cameras have a difficult time metering in these situations.  Sometimes it helps to use manual and underexpose by a fair bit.  There is a bit of foreground bokeh here, but it''s minimal, and it doesn''t really "enhance" the image.  (5)', '2007-11-15 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249244, 610687, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea for foreground bokeh.  The out of focus guitar neck/hand leads us to look at the little girl playing the guitar.  I wonder if having the little girl look at the guitar intently, like she''s really playing away, would also work.  My one nitpick is that the image looks a tad "over noise-ninjaed" (or similar noise removal software).  (7)</td>', 'Good idea for foreground bokeh.  The out of focus guitar neck/hand leads us to look at the little girl playing the guitar.  I wonder if having the little girl look at the guitar intently, like she''s really playing away, would also work.  My one nitpick is that the image looks a tad "over noise-ninjaed" (or similar noise removal software).  (7)', '2007-11-15 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249247, 610891, 5112, '<td valign="top">The out of focus cross flips in and out, foreground to background.  Strange how that happens.  In my personal opinion, there''s too much blank space in this image, two things sort of floating in space, separated by a lot of space, and the placement of the subjects is sort of awkward.  I wonder if placing the Bible more almost behind the cross would work better.  (5)</td>', 'The out of focus cross flips in and out, foreground to background.  Strange how that happens.  In my personal opinion, there''s too much blank space in this image, two things sort of floating in space, separated by a lot of space, and the placement of the subjects is sort of awkward.  I wonder if placing the Bible more almost behind the cross would work better.  (5)', '2007-11-15 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249254, 610668, 5112, '<td valign="top">There definitely is foreground bokeh, but, as it is, does it serve to enhance the image?  IMO, there''s just way too much of it.  If you''d go in closer to the squirrel, and have just a bit of the foreground showing, maybe make the image from a slightly lower angle - it might give it more strength.  Something to try.  (6)</td>', 'There definitely is foreground bokeh, but, as it is, does it serve to enhance the image?  IMO, there''s just way too much of it.  If you''d go in closer to the squirrel, and have just a bit of the foreground showing, maybe make the image from a slightly lower angle - it might give it more strength.  Something to try.  (6)', '2007-11-15 12:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249262, 612892, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I love this one.  Reminds me a bit of an image in one of Freeman Patterson''s books.  A couple things that come to mind:  Did you use a polarizer?  (in situations like this it helps, to reduce glare);  The in focus area is so centred!  The image might be more effective if the in focus area were placed a bit more on one of the thirds (in this case, towards the bottom left I think -- the big leaf out of focus at the bottom is a bit much, and could easily be cut down).  (8)</td>', 'Beautiful, I love this one.  Reminds me a bit of an image in one of Freeman Patterson''s books.  A couple things that come to mind:  Did you use a polarizer?  (in situations like this it helps, to reduce glare);  The in focus area is so centred!  The image might be more effective if the in focus area were placed a bit more on one of the thirds (in this case, towards the bottom left I think -- the big leaf out of focus at the bottom is a bit much, and could easily be cut down).  (8)', '2007-11-15 12:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249280, 612783, 71608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, like how it draws attention to the spider.</td>', 'Beautiful, like how it draws attention to the spider.', '2007-11-15 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249283, 613041, 71608, '<td valign="top">Simple, but really well done. I really like this one!</td>', 'Simple, but really well done. I really like this one!', '2007-11-15 12:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249287, 610006, 71608, '<td valign="top">Wow! Really striking, I have to work out how to do that...</td>', 'Wow! Really striking, I have to work out how to do that...', '2007-11-15 12:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249290, 611498, 71608, '<td valign="top">I love this one! Great focus on the face.</td>', 'I love this one! Great focus on the face.', '2007-11-15 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249323, 611210, 71608, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.', '2007-11-15 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249324, 610668, 71608, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, great capture.</td>', 'Hahaha, great capture.', '2007-11-15 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249343, 613097, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bokeh nicely echoes the catchlights in her eyes.</td>', 'Bokeh nicely echoes the catchlights in her eyes.', '2007-11-15 12:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249352, 611532, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty litte Chickadee and the OOF fall colors complement the bird, especially the reds near the red branches he''s sitting on.  I might try a tighter crop (especially on the right) to make that similarity even more apparent.</td>', 'Pretty litte Chickadee and the OOF fall colors complement the bird, especially the reds near the red branches he''s sitting on.  I might try a tighter crop (especially on the right) to make that similarity even more apparent.', '2007-11-15 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249354, 611498, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am going to give you credit for the positioning of the OOF leaf that appears to be in his hand and therefore say:  nice capture!  Could maybe use a bit more contrast and less brightness.</td>', 'I am going to give you credit for the positioning of the OOF leaf that appears to be in his hand and therefore say:  nice capture!  Could maybe use a bit more contrast and less brightness.', '2007-11-15 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249355, 611642, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not the type of shot I expect in a bokeh challenge, but I certainly see some (even the "circle of light" people should see it).  Great stop-action.</td>', 'Not the type of shot I expect in a bokeh challenge, but I certainly see some (even the "circle of light" people should see it).  Great stop-action.', '2007-11-15 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249356, 610668, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition, and nice detail on the "thief."  Bokeh is subtle but does help define this as a tomb rather than a bench or something.</td>', 'Great angle and composition, and nice detail on the "thief."  Bokeh is subtle but does help define this as a tomb rather than a bench or something.', '2007-11-15 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249371, 612753, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing to have the name Lazarus with what appears to be new leaf growth in the foreground.</td>', 'Quite intriguing to have the name Lazarus with what appears to be new leaf growth in the foreground.', '2007-11-15 12:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249396, 611561, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the eagle.  He looks either cold or angry with his feathers all poufed.  OOF leaves make a decent frame for him.</td>', 'Nice detail on the eagle.  He looks either cold or angry with his feathers all poufed.  OOF leaves make a decent frame for him.', '2007-11-15 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249397, 611176, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my; political bokeh.  Point well made.</td>', 'Oh, my; political bokeh.  Point well made.', '2007-11-15 13:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249510, 610327, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, no doubt, but I see no foreground bokeh.</td>', 'Cool shot, no doubt, but I see no foreground bokeh.', '2007-11-15 14:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249596, 611487, 76198, '<td valign="top">While there is some bokeh in the foregroung I don''t feel that it adds much to the picture; also the on-camera flash has kinda removed all the texture from your walnuts. Looks like there might have been enough light to shoot without flash? That might have helped; as is looks kinda washed out.</td>', 'While there is some bokeh in the foregroung I don''t feel that it adds much to the picture; also the on-camera flash has kinda removed all the texture from your walnuts. Looks like there might have been enough light to shoot without flash? That might have helped; as is looks kinda washed out.', '2007-11-15 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249597, 611456, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is more like it... bokeh in the foreground provides a sense of depth and dimension. Very nice. I like the soft colors.</td>', 'This is more like it... bokeh in the foreground provides a sense of depth and dimension. Very nice. I like the soft colors.', '2007-11-15 14:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249601, 610759, 76198, '<td valign="top">I feel a little like a peeping tom... but peeping at what? The subject and the voyeuristic feel don''t seem to match. The rim lighting on the statue looks great.</td>', 'I feel a little like a peeping tom... but peeping at what? The subject and the voyeuristic feel don''t seem to match. The rim lighting on the statue looks great.', '2007-11-15 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249605, 613002, 76198, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft throughout. Looks like some of the color channels might be saturated, too, in the flowers?</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft throughout. Looks like some of the color channels might be saturated, too, in the flowers?', '2007-11-15 14:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249610, 612265, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful photo... I think there''s some room for discussion about what''s foreground and background and blah blah blah but I''m going to ignore that because you obviously understood the idea and you made a deliberate artistic choice, and it worked spectacularly.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful photo... I think there''s some room for discussion about what''s foreground and background and blah blah blah but I''m going to ignore that because you obviously understood the idea and you made a deliberate artistic choice, and it worked spectacularly.', '2007-11-15 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249618, 612966, 86656, '<td valign="top">Powerlines.</td>', 'Powerlines.', '2007-11-15 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249624, 611385, 76198, '<td valign="top">Idea is perfect; the blown out places and posterization detract, however.</td>', 'Idea is perfect; the blown out places and posterization detract, however.', '2007-11-15 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249627, 611560, 76198, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your</td>', 'I''ll take your', '2007-11-15 14:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249629, 611197, 76198, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Mirrors I assume?</td>', 'Great idea! Mirrors I assume?', '2007-11-15 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249631, 612974, 76198, '<td valign="top">I don''t see foreground bokeh, which is too bad, as it''s otherwise a nice picture.</td>', 'I don''t see foreground bokeh, which is too bad, as it''s otherwise a nice picture.', '2007-11-15 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249634, 611008, 76198, '<td valign="top">Best yet. Really uses the bokeh to tell the story. 10.</td>', 'Best yet. Really uses the bokeh to tell the story. 10.', '2007-11-15 15:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249643, 612472, 76198, '<td valign="top">Pic is a bit soft and dark throughout; some post processing might help that though I think the birds just a bit out of focus. I don''t feel that the foreground bokeh really adds to the picture, either.</td>', 'Pic is a bit soft and dark throughout; some post processing might help that though I think the birds just a bit out of focus. I don''t feel that the foreground bokeh really adds to the picture, either.', '2007-11-15 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4249647, 610327, 76198, '<td valign="top">I see no foreground bokeh? Otherwise a great shot, but for a different challenge.</td>', 'I see no foreground bokeh? Otherwise a great shot, but for a different challenge.', '2007-11-15 15:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
