(4249659, 610748, 77507, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/>Could improve it a bit with a bit more contrast &amp; increase in black clipping.<br/>good sense of depth in it.</td>', 'Nice shot.Could improve it a bit with a bit more contrast & increase in black clipping.good sense of depth in it.', '2007-11-15 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
