(4249979, 612918, 811, '<td valign="top">good use of selective focus.  i do, however, find my eyes "drifting" toward the second guy and expecting him to be in focus, not the third one.</td>', 'good use of selective focus.  i do, however, find my eyes "drifting" toward the second guy and expecting him to be in focus, not the third one.', '2007-11-15 17:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
