(4252274, 611210, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition, with foreground bokeh that truly compliments the subject.</td>', 'Super composition, with foreground bokeh that truly compliments the subject.', '2007-11-16 15:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252280, 613097, 67258, '<td valign="top">The bokeh here certainly compliments, and even adds drama to the main subject.  Neither element would be complete without the presence of the other which, to me was what this challenge was about.  i would like to see a little more post-processing work done on the portrait section, just to finish it off - but good work.</td>', 'The bokeh here certainly compliments, and even adds drama to the main subject.  Neither element would be complete without the presence of the other which, to me was what this challenge was about.  i would like to see a little more post-processing work done on the portrait section, just to finish it off - but good work.', '2007-11-16 15:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252283, 610624, 67258, '<td valign="top">An original image where the foreground bokeh adds impact tothe final photo. I like the way that the dart has a feeling of speed - effective and clever.</td>', 'An original image where the foreground bokeh adds impact tothe final photo. I like the way that the dart has a feeling of speed - effective and clever.', '2007-11-16 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252288, 612914, 67258, '<td valign="top">A rather sweet, and certainly interesting, photo - BUT, I don''t see any foreground bokeh.</td>', 'A rather sweet, and certainly interesting, photo - BUT, I don''t see any foreground bokeh.', '2007-11-16 15:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252419, 611642, 3444, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I would have loved to see the ball in the frame as well.</td>', 'Nice shot, I would have loved to see the ball in the frame as well.', '2007-11-16 16:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252540, 611008, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like how this has such simplicity to it, yet speaks volumes.</td>', 'I like how this has such simplicity to it, yet speaks volumes.', '2007-11-16 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252633, 612787, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject Photo, unfortunately the forground bokeh has carried through onto the suject, bringing the background foreword. to overcome this focus with auto on the foreground, and then set to manual focus and reposition your frame at the subject.  5</td>', 'This is a good subject Photo, unfortunately the forground bokeh has carried through onto the suject, bringing the background foreword. to overcome this focus with auto on the foreground, and then set to manual focus and reposition your frame at the subject.  5', '2007-11-16 18:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252634, 612457, 33352, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is in the background..</td>', 'The bokeh is in the background..', '2007-11-16 18:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252777, 612613, 33352, '<td valign="top">Like so many your out of focus is in bth grounds with your subject in the middle, IMO this all comes down to individual interpretation of the challenge details. I personally like to stay close to the details of the challenge as possible. The suject is good the lighting is suitable for the subject, with the subject in focus, I actually gave this a 6....</td>', 'Like so many your out of focus is in bth grounds with your subject in the middle, IMO this all comes down to individual interpretation of the challenge details. I personally like to stay close to the details of the challenge as possible. The suject is good the lighting is suitable for the subject, with the subject in focus, I actually gave this a 6....', '2007-11-16 19:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252788, 612371, 76598, '<td valign="top">Exposure wrong, white balance wrong, poor focus</td>', 'Exposure wrong, white balance wrong, poor focus', '2007-11-16 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253087, 612811, 72670, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! But I don''t see the bokeh in this shot.</td>', 'Spectacular! But I don''t see the bokeh in this shot.', '2007-11-16 22:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253206, 610006, 39850, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a bokeh overload (I mean that in a good sense).  Interesting image.  Guessing it is too busy in color.  Like to see more of a focal point though.. difficult.</td>', 'Now that''s a bokeh overload (I mean that in a good sense).  Interesting image.  Guessing it is too busy in color.  Like to see more of a focal point though.. difficult.', '2007-11-16 23:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253218, 612364, 46832, '<td valign="top">Vociferous???  Are you sure?  Maybe you meant Voracious?</td>', 'Vociferous???  Are you sure?  Maybe you meant Voracious?', '2007-11-16 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253227, 613014, 46832, '<td valign="top">I don''s see the foreground.  I don''t see the bokeh.</td>', 'I don''s see the foreground.  I don''t see the bokeh.', '2007-11-16 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253234, 612921, 46832, '<td valign="top">What is it that we are trying not to forget?  I can''t tell.</td>', 'What is it that we are trying not to forget?  I can''t tell.', '2007-11-16 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253237, 611005, 46832, '<td valign="top">No foreground bokeh...</td>', 'No foreground bokeh...', '2007-11-16 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253246, 612974, 46832, '<td valign="top">FOREGROUND bokeh... not background...</td>', 'FOREGROUND bokeh... not background...', '2007-11-17 00:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253250, 610327, 46832, '<td valign="top">No forground bokeh...</td>', 'No forground bokeh...', '2007-11-17 00:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253298, 612608, 60321, '<td valign="top">I feel that there are too many elements in the picture and the in focus part of the picture does not do enough to pull the viewers attention from the rest of the picture</td>', 'I feel that there are too many elements in the picture and the in focus part of the picture does not do enough to pull the viewers attention from the rest of the picture', '2007-11-17 01:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253299, 612940, 60321, '<td valign="top">I feel that its too busy. I had to look twice to notice the in-focus part of the picture</td>', 'I feel that its too busy. I had to look twice to notice the in-focus part of the picture', '2007-11-17 01:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253300, 611010, 60321, '<td valign="top">:-)</td>', ':-)', '2007-11-17 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253303, 612561, 60321, '<td valign="top">Maybe you could have focused more on the lamp of the lighthouse, therefore blurring out the foreground a little more.</td>', 'Maybe you could have focused more on the lamp of the lighthouse, therefore blurring out the foreground a little more.', '2007-11-17 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253304, 612399, 60321, '<td valign="top">sorry, i don''t see the Bokeh</td>', 'sorry, i don''t see the Bokeh', '2007-11-17 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253305, 610001, 60321, '<td valign="top">the foreground is not that bokeh :(</td>', 'the foreground is not that bokeh :(', '2007-11-17 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253309, 611498, 60321, '<td valign="top">Where''s the Bokeh. I guess since there are so many leaves on the ground the Bokeh part seems to come across as natural capture of a leaf covered ground.</td>', 'Where''s the Bokeh. I guess since there are so many leaves on the ground the Bokeh part seems to come across as natural capture of a leaf covered ground.', '2007-11-17 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253313, 612991, 60321, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more of the Anthurium, maybe a little stem to give it a little more completeness.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more of the Anthurium, maybe a little stem to give it a little more completeness.', '2007-11-17 01:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253315, 612457, 60321, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge? i dont see a foreground bokeh</td>', 'Wrong challenge? i dont see a foreground bokeh', '2007-11-17 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253316, 611507, 60321, '<td valign="top">The infocus should have been more focused or something a little more prominent.</td>', 'The infocus should have been more focused or something a little more prominent.', '2007-11-17 01:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253319, 611504, 60321, '<td valign="top">nice color composition</td>', 'nice color composition', '2007-11-17 01:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253321, 611656, 60321, '<td valign="top">very nice vibrant colors, but needs more bokeh</td>', 'very nice vibrant colors, but needs more bokeh', '2007-11-17 01:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253322, 612947, 60321, '<td valign="top">This seems to have more background bokeh, but nice picture overall.</td>', 'This seems to have more background bokeh, but nice picture overall.', '2007-11-17 01:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253326, 611402, 60321, '<td valign="top">Very well composed with good contrast.  Excellent use of bokeh while maitaining the presence of the foreground image.</td>', 'Very well composed with good contrast.  Excellent use of bokeh while maitaining the presence of the foreground image.', '2007-11-17 01:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253329, 611013, 60321, '<td valign="top">The amount of bokeh overtakes the main focus of the picture.</td>', 'The amount of bokeh overtakes the main focus of the picture.', '2007-11-17 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253331, 611210, 60321, '<td valign="top">well-composed, good use of bokeh</td>', 'well-composed, good use of bokeh', '2007-11-17 01:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253333, 612370, 60321, '<td valign="top">Nice classic feel to image.</td>', 'Nice classic feel to image.', '2007-11-17 01:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253339, 610717, 60321, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. Very nicely composed. I only wish the second leaf was shorter and didn''t block as much of the henon''s neck</td>', 'I really like this picture. Very nicely composed. I only wish the second leaf was shorter and didn''t block as much of the henon''s neck', '2007-11-17 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253347, 612530, 60321, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I wonder if the picture would have come across better if the model was looking though with a straight face and not at an angle. maybe focus a little sharper on the eye so that her eye lashes were more prominent.</td>', 'Very interesting. I wonder if the picture would have come across better if the model was looking though with a straight face and not at an angle. maybe focus a little sharper on the eye so that her eye lashes were more prominent.', '2007-11-17 01:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253348, 610471, 60321, '<td valign="top">Nice. I dont know what else to say :D</td>', 'Nice. I dont know what else to say :D', '2007-11-17 01:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253353, 610984, 60321, '<td valign="top">I like the color composition</td>', 'I like the color composition', '2007-11-17 01:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253374, 610006, 39430, '<td valign="top">Without the bokeh, it''s not that great a photo, but the interesting shape, and so many of them overlapping makes it quite interesting.  Almost a Christmas feel to it.  You''re score goes up the longer I look at it.  :)</td>', 'Without the bokeh, it''s not that great a photo, but the interesting shape, and so many of them overlapping makes it quite interesting.  Almost a Christmas feel to it.  You''re score goes up the longer I look at it.  :)', '2007-11-17 02:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253376, 612477, 39430, '<td valign="top">Could be slightly sharper on the subject, but I like the way you''ve used the focus point to pull a particular bottle out from behind the others.  I''d try cropping just a little of the RHS.</td>', 'Could be slightly sharper on the subject, but I like the way you''ve used the focus point to pull a particular bottle out from behind the others.  I''d try cropping just a little of the RHS.', '2007-11-17 02:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253377, 610951, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus on the duck, but not a bad composition.</td>', 'Not quite in focus on the duck, but not a bad composition.', '2007-11-17 02:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253378, 612409, 39430, '<td valign="top">Looks like big black hair.  :)  The viewing angle on the face is a little odd.  Might be better if they had their head tipp forward.</td>', 'Looks like big black hair.  :)  The viewing angle on the face is a little odd.  Might be better if they had their head tipp forward.', '2007-11-17 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253379, 611487, 39430, '<td valign="top">I would adjust the curves for a little more contrast and add more colour.</td>', 'I would adjust the curves for a little more contrast and add more colour.', '2007-11-17 02:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253381, 612476, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice sillhoette, but is there any foreground bokeh?  Looks like it''s in the background.  Hard to tell, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Nice sillhoette, but is there any foreground bokeh?  Looks like it''s in the background.  Hard to tell, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2007-11-17 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253385, 612364, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting catch.  Pity it''s so washed-out red.  Perhaps a diffused on-camera flash would have lit the bee with natural colours.</td>', 'This is an interesting catch.  Pity it''s so washed-out red.  Perhaps a diffused on-camera flash would have lit the bee with natural colours.', '2007-11-17 02:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253388, 610589, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting play of colours.  The bokeh is more significantly in the BG, but there is a little bit in the FG.  Wierd bokeh shape!  I wonder what sort of lens this is?  Makes some nice textures.</td>', 'Interesting play of colours.  The bokeh is more significantly in the BG, but there is a little bit in the FG.  Wierd bokeh shape!  I wonder what sort of lens this is?  Makes some nice textures.', '2007-11-17 02:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253389, 612915, 39430, '<td valign="top">Quirky.  Looks like a bit of camera shake.</td>', 'Quirky.  Looks like a bit of camera shake.', '2007-11-17 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253390, 612561, 39430, '<td valign="top">Overall nice.  Pity the sky is so bright.  Maybe a different angle would give a brighter subject against the sky.  You could also give this a touch more saturation without any problems.</td>', 'Overall nice.  Pity the sky is so bright.  Maybe a different angle would give a brighter subject against the sky.  You could also give this a touch more saturation without any problems.', '2007-11-17 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253393, 612526, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, it fits the challenge, but couldn''t you find a more interesting subject than a billboard crisscrossed with power lines?  :)</td>', 'Well, it fits the challenge, but couldn''t you find a more interesting subject than a billboard crisscrossed with power lines?  :)', '2007-11-17 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253394, 613099, 39430, '<td valign="top">Most of the bokeh is in the background.  You could have tried a photo of the house with all the FG leaves blurred.</td>', 'Most of the bokeh is in the background.  You could have tried a photo of the house with all the FG leaves blurred.', '2007-11-17 02:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253398, 611027, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great colours, and meets the challenge well, which seems to be rare.  :)</td>', 'Nice composition, great colours, and meets the challenge well, which seems to be rare.  :)', '2007-11-17 02:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253399, 611642, 39430, '<td valign="top">Would be better if the subject of the shot was actually doing something.  This photo just tells me that there''s something interesting happening somewhere else, and we''re missing it!</td>', 'Would be better if the subject of the shot was actually doing something.  This photo just tells me that there''s something interesting happening somewhere else, and we''re missing it!', '2007-11-17 02:22:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4253400, 612980, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice.  From the thumb, I thought her hair was purple.  :)</td>', 'Nice.  From the thumb, I thought her hair was purple.  :)', '2007-11-17 02:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253402, 611402, 39430, '<td valign="top">The bird gets a bit lost in this BW.  I''d also go for a square composition on this shot.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'The bird gets a bit lost in this BW.  I''d also go for a square composition on this shot.  Meets the challenge well.', '2007-11-17 02:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253403, 612940, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is really nice   Colours and composition are great.  Foreground bokeh is not really significant over bg bokeh, but now I''m just getting picky.</td>', 'This is really nice   Colours and composition are great.  Foreground bokeh is not really significant over bg bokeh, but now I''m just getting picky.', '2007-11-17 02:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253404, 611073, 39430, '<td valign="top">A little bit of noise is a pity.  Nice colours.</td>', 'A little bit of noise is a pity.  Nice colours.', '2007-11-17 02:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253424, 612751, 45631, '<td valign="top">A great image but not seeing any foreground bokeh.  A little out of focus yes but bokeh... no</td>', 'A great image but not seeing any foreground bokeh.  A little out of focus yes but bokeh... no', '2007-11-17 03:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253427, 612958, 45631, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and within the challenge as I see it.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot and within the challenge as I see it.  Well done.', '2007-11-17 03:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253428, 611005, 45631, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing something here but I don''t see any foreground bokeh on this image at all.  Sorry</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing something here but I don''t see any foreground bokeh on this image at all.  Sorry', '2007-11-17 03:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253429, 610758, 45631, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge as I understand it and a lovely sharp image.  Pity there are two of these (don''t you just hate that).</td>', 'Meets the challenge as I understand it and a lovely sharp image.  Pity there are two of these (don''t you just hate that).', '2007-11-17 03:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253444, 612526, 45631, '<td valign="top">I feel you have the foreground bokeh correct but the subject matter is no very interesting.</td>', 'I feel you have the foreground bokeh correct but the subject matter is no very interesting.', '2007-11-17 03:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253447, 613077, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a really great image but I don''t see it meeting the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really great image but I don''t see it meeting the challenge.', '2007-11-17 03:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253465, 613014, 45631, '<td valign="top">This a pretty image but I don''t see any foreground bokeh at all.</td>', 'This a pretty image but I don''t see any foreground bokeh at all.', '2007-11-17 03:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253468, 612753, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image and one that I think truly meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely image and one that I think truly meets the challenge.', '2007-11-17 04:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253486, 612528, 45631, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and the candlesdo have the bokeh.  This is such a hard challenge to judge but I think that this does meet the challenge for me and I the emotion in the image just sells it 100%.  Great job.</td>', 'A lovely image and the candlesdo have the bokeh.  This is such a hard challenge to judge but I think that this does meet the challenge for me and I the emotion in the image just sells it 100%.  Great job.', '2007-11-17 04:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253488, 611013, 45631, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Bokeh is truly in the foreground for this (and not many have met the challenge well).  And a nice image also.  Well done.</td>', 'Very well done.  Bokeh is truly in the foreground for this (and not many have met the challenge well).  And a nice image also.  Well done.', '2007-11-17 04:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253502, 612962, 39430, '<td valign="top">Did you enter the right challenge?  I see stopped motion, but I don''t really see any foreground bokeh.  :(</td>', 'Did you enter the right challenge?  I see stopped motion, but I don''t really see any foreground bokeh.  :(', '2007-11-17 04:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253503, 611005, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s no bokeh here!  At a stretch, maybe a tiny bit right in the BG, but none in the foreground.</td>', 'There''s no bokeh here!  At a stretch, maybe a tiny bit right in the BG, but none in the foreground.', '2007-11-17 04:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253504, 612959, 39430, '<td valign="top">Colour balance looks a little on the blue side.  Try setting the WB to cloudy or shade.  Nice bird.</td>', 'Colour balance looks a little on the blue side.  Try setting the WB to cloudy or shade.  Nice bird.', '2007-11-17 04:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253505, 612370, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and the title helps to clear up those words.  :)</td>', 'Nice composition, and the title helps to clear up those words.  :)', '2007-11-17 04:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253508, 613094, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Might be a little more engaging if we could see her eyes.  I''d also prefer to see her a bit lighter.  But overall, nice work.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Might be a little more engaging if we could see her eyes.  I''d also prefer to see her a bit lighter.  But overall, nice work.', '2007-11-17 04:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253516, 612751, 39430, '<td valign="top">A little too oversaturated for my liking, but I know it''s hard to avoid that when you are working with childrens toys.  :)  Cute little suit.</td>', 'A little too oversaturated for my liking, but I know it''s hard to avoid that when you are working with childrens toys.  :)  Cute little suit.', '2007-11-17 05:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253517, 612371, 39430, '<td valign="top">Exposure is pretty bad, and the pine-cone is not very interestingly displayed here.</td>', 'Exposure is pretty bad, and the pine-cone is not very interestingly displayed here.', '2007-11-17 05:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253518, 611418, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, and simple, but maybe a bit too simple?  Just lacks something interesting to look at.</td>', 'Nice colours, and simple, but maybe a bit too simple?  Just lacks something interesting to look at.', '2007-11-17 05:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253519, 612892, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice play of colours between the orange and blue, and the bokeh is definitely a significant part of this composition.</td>', 'Nice play of colours between the orange and blue, and the bokeh is definitely a significant part of this composition.', '2007-11-17 05:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253520, 612942, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is, but is looks cool.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is, but is looks cool.', '2007-11-17 05:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253521, 611378, 39430, '<td valign="top">I read the title and wasn''t looking forward to the image of a magpie in somebody''s garden, but this surprised me.  The colours work really well together.  Subject would be better not looking away from the camera.</td>', 'I read the title and wasn''t looking forward to the image of a magpie in somebody''s garden, but this surprised me.  The colours work really well together.  Subject would be better not looking away from the camera.', '2007-11-17 05:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253522, 611794, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing coloured trees!  My only criticism is that the foreground leaves are very disconnected from the rest of the image.  If there was a way to frame the background with the close-up leaves, that would be better.</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing coloured trees!  My only criticism is that the foreground leaves are very disconnected from the rest of the image.  If there was a way to frame the background with the close-up leaves, that would be better.', '2007-11-17 05:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253523, 610372, 39430, '<td valign="top">The foregrounds gets in the way here.  Rather than adding to the composition, I feel it detracts.</td>', 'The foregrounds gets in the way here.  Rather than adding to the composition, I feel it detracts.', '2007-11-17 05:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253524, 612323, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the angle was on purpose, but it looks OK.  You could even put this on more of an angle.  That guy is looking suspicious.  You better run before he sets his dog on you.  :)</td>', 'I don''t know if the angle was on purpose, but it looks OK.  You could even put this on more of an angle.  That guy is looking suspicious.  You better run before he sets his dog on you.  :)', '2007-11-17 05:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253525, 612848, 39430, '<td valign="top">The ball melts into the rest of the picture a little, but this is basic editing, so you''d have to figure out some way to put a shadow behind the ball to help this.</td>', 'The ball melts into the rest of the picture a little, but this is basic editing, so you''d have to figure out some way to put a shadow behind the ball to help this.', '2007-11-17 05:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253526, 612416, 39430, '<td valign="top">The selective desay there is a little offputting for me.  Nice composition though.</td>', 'The selective desay there is a little offputting for me.  Nice composition though.', '2007-11-17 05:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253527, 610070, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s already been commented on, but there''s a lot of noise here.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s already been commented on, but there''s a lot of noise here.', '2007-11-17 05:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253529, 612966, 39430, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with a slightly closer crop to get rid of the wire.</td>', 'Would have been better with a slightly closer crop to get rid of the wire.', '2007-11-17 05:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253530, 612534, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, I never thought I''d say it, but this crop is TOO close.  :)</td>', 'Well, I never thought I''d say it, but this crop is TOO close.  :)', '2007-11-17 05:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253533, 613098, 39430, '<td valign="top">Focus is very soft, and there''s something wierd happening with the colours.  Overall, I don''t mind it, but the details don''t quite deliver.</td>', 'Focus is very soft, and there''s something wierd happening with the colours.  Overall, I don''t mind it, but the details don''t quite deliver.', '2007-11-17 05:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
