(4253610, 611498, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and the colours work really well together.  There''s something about the composition that makes it look like he''s going to fall from there, but overall, it''s a great portrait.  There''s some exposure problems, but I''m going to ignore them and give you top marks.</td>', 'Nice composition, and the colours work really well together.  There''s something about the composition that makes it look like he''s going to fall from there, but overall, it''s a great portrait.  There''s some exposure problems, but I''m going to ignore them and give you top marks.', '2007-11-17 06:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253611, 612954, 39430, '<td valign="top">Aww, very cute.  You could push the saturation up a little to help pop this image.</td>', 'Aww, very cute.  You could push the saturation up a little to help pop this image.', '2007-11-17 06:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253612, 612918, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lineup.  Would be nicer if the aperture was a little wider, and the focus point more clearly on the 2nd guy from the back.  My daughter was crying at 2am last night because she lost her pee pee flower.  It took me a while to realise she meant her poppy flower!</td>', 'Nice lineup.  Would be nicer if the aperture was a little wider, and the focus point more clearly on the 2nd guy from the back.  My daughter was crying at 2am last night because she lost her pee pee flower.  It took me a while to realise she meant her poppy flower!', '2007-11-17 06:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253614, 612513, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very clever use of bokeh.  I''m not sure exactly how you got the different colours, but I''m assuming there''s at least one pane of glass between the camera and her face.  Nice creative shot.</td>', 'Very clever use of bokeh.  I''m not sure exactly how you got the different colours, but I''m assuming there''s at least one pane of glass between the camera and her face.  Nice creative shot.', '2007-11-17 06:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
