(4253617, 610687, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!  The crop just chops her head.  I''m not sure if it''s bad, maybe it helps the intimacy of the photo, but maybe it would look better with just a little more headroom.</td>', 'Great portrait!  The crop just chops her head.  I''m not sure if it''s bad, maybe it helps the intimacy of the photo, but maybe it would look better with just a little more headroom.', '2007-11-17 06:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
