(4253619, 612849, 39430, '<td valign="top">Impressive costume, but not a great photo.  Subject is not quite in focus, and that blurry hand really doesn''t add anything to the photo - it''s just distracting.</td>', 'Impressive costume, but not a great photo.  Subject is not quite in focus, and that blurry hand really doesn''t add anything to the photo - it''s just distracting.', '2007-11-17 06:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
