(4254752, 611504, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Shots like this are tricky to execute, the main reason being is you want to eliminate shadows, especially on white boards where it will pickup the slightest shadow, usually several strategically placed (at least one sort of diffused light for evenness) lights. This shot is slightly overexposed as well. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the idea. Shots like this are tricky to execute, the main reason being is you want to eliminate shadows, especially on white boards where it will pickup the slightest shadow, usually several strategically placed (at least one sort of diffused light for evenness) lights. This shot is slightly overexposed as well. Good luck!', '2007-11-17 22:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
