(4258881, 612457, 37623, '<td valign="top">a nice dog shot always warms my heart, but for this one, i don''t see the foreground bokeh.  i still like the shot...pet the dog for me!</td>', 'a nice dog shot always warms my heart, but for this one, i don''t see the foreground bokeh.  i still like the shot...pet the dog for me!', '2007-11-19 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4258883, 611109, 37623, '<td valign="top">very beautiful, but i would have liked to see a little more foreground bokeh</td>', 'very beautiful, but i would have liked to see a little more foreground bokeh', '2007-11-19 19:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4258884, 612608, 37623, '<td valign="top">nice, but i find the leaves in the foreground a bit of a distraction</td>', 'nice, but i find the leaves in the foreground a bit of a distraction', '2007-11-19 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4258889, 611794, 37623, '<td valign="top">the leaves in the foreground (falling) did provide the sense of foreground bokeh, but i find them a bit distracting.  just wonder if you could have found some other foreground object to bokeh-ize.  still, a beautiful photo</td>', 'the leaves in the foreground (falling) did provide the sense of foreground bokeh, but i find them a bit distracting.  just wonder if you could have found some other foreground object to bokeh-ize.  still, a beautiful photo', '2007-11-19 19:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259911, 611379, 22245, '<td valign="top">this is a great example of photo journalism!</td>', 'this is a great example of photo journalism!', '2007-11-20 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259913, 612919, 22245, '<td valign="top">the focus seems a little off here. this photo could do with a bit more sharpening to bring out the lettering in the monument. would also be a much better shot if you could see the man entirely.</td>', 'the focus seems a little off here. this photo could do with a bit more sharpening to bring out the lettering in the monument. would also be a much better shot if you could see the man entirely.', '2007-11-20 07:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259914, 613023, 22245, '<td valign="top">I love the way you used noise here to capture a feeling!</td>', 'I love the way you used noise here to capture a feeling!', '2007-11-20 07:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259918, 612714, 22245, '<td valign="top">this image has great composition; however the sky is very overblown. It makes it difficult for the eye to go straight to the bird. My vision was fist drawn to the leaves on the left, which has a little too much noise for my liking. Could benefit  from a little noise reduction and some unsharp mask.</td>', 'this image has great composition; however the sky is very overblown. It makes it difficult for the eye to go straight to the bird. My vision was fist drawn to the leaves on the left, which has a little too much noise for my liking. Could benefit  from a little noise reduction and some unsharp mask.', '2007-11-20 07:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259923, 613092, 22245, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The lighting, the colors the compositing it is all just perfet! You must tell me how you did the lighting for this shot. This is what photography is all about. you most certainly painted with light! 10!</td>', 'I love this photo. The lighting, the colors the compositing it is all just perfet! You must tell me how you did the lighting for this shot. This is what photography is all about. you most certainly painted with light! 10!', '2007-11-20 07:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259926, 613098, 22245, '<td valign="top">looks like a seen from th movie bambie! cute</td>', 'looks like a seen from th movie bambie! cute', '2007-11-20 07:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259932, 611210, 22245, '<td valign="top">very ansil adams! love it!</td>', 'very ansil adams! love it!', '2007-11-20 07:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4259939, 613013, 22245, '<td valign="top">would have been a 10 from me if you had used a realistic toy gun for this image. It reminds me of one from a photographer from a documentary I saw. His was done with 2 little boys one was pointing the gun right at the camera it is a fantastic image I wish I could remember his name</td>', 'would have been a 10 from me if you had used a realistic toy gun for this image. It reminds me of one from a photographer from a documentary I saw. His was done with 2 little boys one was pointing the gun right at the camera it is a fantastic image I wish I could remember his name', '2007-11-20 07:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
