(4261754, 610758, 37444, '<td valign="top">Thanks voters! I really did not expect to do this well since  several of my previous entries were ... well, not as good!<br/> <br/>I literally got on the ground for this one and took several shots and this one seemed the best to enter because the bokeh mirrored the grasses bending in the wind.</td>', 'Thanks voters! I really did not expect to do this well since  several of my previous entries were ... well, not as good! I literally got on the ground for this one and took several shots and this one seemed the best to enter because the bokeh mirrored the grasses bending in the wind.', '2007-11-21 00:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
