(4262070, 611507, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well, I stand by my vote of 9, and actually see even more in this that I like!  The composition is subtle and provides much of the photos success for me - the yellow in the lower right corner, with the burst of green fanning out from it.  i love the dichotomy of the sense of frenetic activity and energy provided by the foreground bokeh contrasting with the serene peacefulness of the background that we get a peak of - had the background been more visible it would have reduced the impact considerably.</td>', 'Well, I stand by my vote of 9, and actually see even more in this that I like!  The composition is subtle and provides much of the photos success for me - the yellow in the lower right corner, with the burst of green fanning out from it.  i love the dichotomy of the sense of frenetic activity and energy provided by the foreground bokeh contrasting with the serene peacefulness of the background that we get a peak of - had the background been more visible it would have reduced the impact considerably.', '2007-11-21 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 0);
