(4263059, 612958, 19944, '<td valign="top">To me, the foreground bokeh is not immediately apparent.  Becasue it is almost completely below the gulls, the green actually appears to be a bush beyond them.  Upon much closer inspection I see that, yes, it is in front of them.  I think that that is where your score suffered.  People vote quickly, and may not have picked up that it was in the foreground.<br/> <br/>I too agree with JuliBoc.  I wish the gulls were facing the camera.  But otherwise, I like the shot.</td>', 'To me, the foreground bokeh is not immediately apparent.  Becasue it is almost completely below the gulls, the green actually appears to be a bush beyond them.  Upon much closer inspection I see that, yes, it is in front of them.  I think that that is where your score suffered.  People vote quickly, and may not have picked up that it was in the foreground. I too agree with JuliBoc.  I wish the gulls were facing the camera.  But otherwise, I like the shot.', '2007-11-21 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
